    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pixh](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pixh) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 94.454 depth occurred on Jan 09 2025 10km E of Acajutla. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 13.5917 longitude -89.7442. It impacted 1196484 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
